




╭─ Help ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Move (NORMAL)                                             Compose (INSERT)                                            │
│  j/↓         move down (newer)                             Enter       send                                          │
│  k/↑         move up (older; loads history at the top)     A-Enter/C-j new line                                      │
│  g           go to the top                                 Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread             │
│  G           go to the newest                                                                                        │
│  h/←         pane to the left                            Messages (NORMAL)                                           │
│  l/→         pane to the right                             e           edit your message                             │
│  Tab         next pane                                     D           delete your message (asks y/n)                │
│  S-Tab       previous pane                                 R           reply in the message's thread                 │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Conversations                                             Autocomplete (INSERT)                                       │
│  Enter       open conversation / thread of message         @ # :       suggest people, channels, emoji               │
│  1–9         switch workspace                              Tab/Enter   pick the suggestion (Esc closes)              │
│  C-k/C-t     find a conversation (coming soon)             ↓/C-n       next suggestion                               │
│  C-b         show or hide the sidebar                      ↑/C-p       previous suggestion                           │
│  <           narrower sidebar                                                                                        │
│  >           wider sidebar                               Commands (COMMAND)                                          │
│                                                            :q            quit                                        │
│Modes                                                       :open <name>  open a conversation by name (#general, @ana)│
│  i           write a message (INSERT)                      :help         this help                                   │
│  :           command line (COMMAND)                                                                                  │
│  Esc         back to NORMAL / close the thread                                                                       │
│  ?           this help                                                                                               │
│  q           quit                                                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                      │
│Press any key to close.                                                                                               │
